OL,3,GNorth East
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FCloudy and
OL,6,Fbreezy at times tonight with outbreaks
OL,7,Fof rain throughout. Becoming cold,
OL,8,Fwith frost developing across western
OL,9,Fparts and over higher ground. Risk of
OL,10,Ficy stretches on untreated surfaces.
OL,11,
OL,12,CMonday:FCloudy with hill fog and
OL,13,Foutbreaks of rain first thing, but
OL,14,Fsoon becoming largely dry with sunny
OL,15,Fspells, though a few showers are
OL,16,Fpossible near the coast. Cold.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
